 biggest percentage decliners, shares of Nike Inc. NKE, -5.90% shed 2.8%, Microsoft Corp. MSFT, -4.17% slid 2.4% and Goldman Sachs Group Inc. GS, -2.31% gave up 2.2%. The biggest drag on the was Boeing Co.'s stock, which fell $4.09, or 1.3%, to shave about 28 points off the Dow's price. The most active stock was Apple Inc.'s AAPL, -2.59% which fell 1.2%.\n ", "external_links": ["https://smartasset.com/snippet.js"], "published": "2018-12-24T21:47:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-12-24T16:47:27.008+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}